r back office functions in order to speed up our organization and focus on the highest value activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/20/alcon-inc-alc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2019 Q3","e":"alc","d":"2019-11-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy Stonesifer","x":"Savings will be driven primarily by simplifying and rightsizing our infrastructure, creating a global shared services platform and driving process improvement and automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/20/alcon-inc-alc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2019 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2020-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"Since becoming independent, we have invested in direct-to-consumer advertising, which has increased the growth profile of our sustained family of products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/alcon-inc-alc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2019 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2020-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"We also had pressure from China tariffs, the uncertainty of Brexit and the new Japanese consumption tax.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/alcon-inc-alc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2019 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2020-02-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"Now moving down the income statement, core gross margin was 63.3% for the full year, broadly in line with prior year with a favorable product mix and product cost absorbing the impact of the China tariffs and foreign currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/alcon-inc-alc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2019 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"Transformation costs for the full-year 2019 were $52 million, primarily related to restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/alcon-inc-alc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q1","e":"alc","d":"2020-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"In Vision Care, we are increasingly engaging our customers online through digital channels and supporting the robust demand at owned and third-party e-commerce platforms with inventory and new direct to consumer models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/alcon-inc-alc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q1","e":"alc","d":"2020-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"Transformation costs this quarter were $7 million, primarily related to third-party consulting fees and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/alcon-inc-alc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q1","e":"alc","d":"2020-05-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"We've implemented a hiring freeze across the Company and eliminated almost all travel, meetings, and consulting spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/alcon-inc-alc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q2","e":"alc","d":"2020-08-19","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"This program helps optometrists address their patient needs through Alcon's own direct to consumer fulfillment capabilities, which contributes to patient satisfaction and strengthens the doctor patient relationship.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/19/alcon-inc-alc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q2","e":"alc","d":"2020-08-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"Aggressive controls around discretionary spend included implementing a hiring freeze, reducing a meaningful amount of sales and marketing spend and almost all travel, meetings and consulting expense were reduced.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/19/alcon-inc-alc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q2","e":"alc","d":"2020-08-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"Transformation costs this quarter were $13 million primarily related to third-party consulting fees and restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/19/alcon-inc-alc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q3","e":"alc","d":"2020-11-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"Our transformation program continued on schedule as we stand up our global service centers, simplify processes and streamline work in our core support functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/alcon-inc-alc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"We're making progress in optimizing our cost structure, which is also allowing us to reinvest cost savings into research and development and marketing to drive our top-line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/alcon-inc-alc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2020 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"Life-to-date transformation costs were $101 million and we have recognized cost savings of $90 million, which have been reinvested back into the business to support product launches such as Pataday.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/alcon-inc-alc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2021 Q2","e":"alc","d":"2021-08-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"We're piloting our comprehensive cloud-based digital health solutions platform, our SMART Suite, which is designed to help ophthalmology practices streamline and create efficiencies in the cataract workflow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/18/alcon-inc-alc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2021 Q2","e":"alc","d":"2021-08-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"Our cost envelope is about the right size, if you think about G&A and all that type of stuff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/18/alcon-inc-alc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2021 Q3","e":"alc","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tim Stonesifer","x":"We continue to see inflationary headwinds related to raw materials, freight and labor despite our best efforts to mitigate these pressures through active management of supply and selective price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/alcon-inc-alc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2025 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David J. Endicott","x":"In the fourth quarter, we also launched a direct-to-consumer advertising campaign on Systane Pro to help broaden awareness and drive trial.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/alcon-alc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2025 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy C. Stonesifer","x":"Now moving down the income statement, fourth quarter core gross margin was 62.5%, down 50 basis points year over year, mainly driven by incremental tariffs, partially offset by price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/alcon-alc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2025 Q4","e":"alc","d":"2026-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Timothy C. Stonesifer","x":"Regarding tariffs, we incurred $91 million of tariff-related charges in 2025, of which $67 million was recognized in cost of sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/alcon-alc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALC 2025 Q4"